.omc/
.omx/
.agents/state/
.agents/notes/
.worktrees/
# Serena: 팀 공용 설정(project.yml)만 추적하고 cache·memories·로컬 override는 제외한다
.serena/*
!.serena/project.yml
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
storybook-static/
.pnpm-store/
*.tsbuildinfo

